WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.284 --> 00:00:01.594
This is pretty fascinating.

00:00:01.594 --> 00:00:04.675
As I've said, tap-taps are how

00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:07.345
everybody gets around in Haiti,

00:00:07.345 --> 00:00:10.235
these beautifully colored painted buses

00:00:10.235 --> 00:00:13.146
and they're painted by artists with icons.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.100
This is Anthony, Thony,
and you're from Haiti.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:16.976
Yeah, I'm from Haiti.

00:00:16.976 --> 00:00:17.809
Nice to meet you.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:18.642
And are you an artist?

00:00:18.642 --> 00:00:19.965
Yeah, I'm an artist, I'm a visual artist.

00:00:19.965 --> 00:00:21.555
Tell me what you've done.

00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:23.603
At 1:00 in the morning,

00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:25.473
my girlfriend just broke up with me.

00:00:25.473 --> 00:00:27.677
I was crying at night and I was like,

00:00:27.677 --> 00:00:31.225
it's either I go out or I
stay home to do what I love

00:00:31.225 --> 00:00:33.856
and then I decided to
make the illustration.

00:00:33.856 --> 00:00:36.425
Oh my god, this is fantastic.

00:00:36.425 --> 00:00:37.508
Look at this.

00:00:38.797 --> 00:00:40.413
You've captured me.

00:00:40.413 --> 00:00:42.397
Kind of sweaty and nervous.

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:43.230
This is really nice.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.500
I would love to see this on a tap-tap.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.333
That would be great.

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:47.166
It's possible.

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:48.580
That would be, we're
gonna make this happen.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.413
That would be great.

00:00:49.413 --> 00:00:51.164
I have to because I'm up there with,

00:00:51.164 --> 00:00:52.780
you think about it,

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.209
there's Rihanna, there's Lionel Messi,

00:00:56.209 --> 00:00:57.645
Yeah, Jesus.
Jesus.

00:00:57.645 --> 00:00:58.616
And then Conan.

00:00:58.616 --> 00:01:01.209
That's usually the four,
if you think of it.

00:01:01.209 --> 00:01:02.292
Right?
Yeah.

00:01:03.307 --> 00:01:06.556
So this all happened because you broke up.

00:01:06.556 --> 00:01:07.753
Your girlfriend broke up with you?

00:01:07.753 --> 00:01:08.586
Yeah.

00:01:08.586 --> 00:01:11.196
Once it gets out that you've done this,

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:12.674
you're gonna have many options.

00:01:12.674 --> 00:01:13.760
Okay?
(laughs)

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.111
You are my personal portrait artist

00:01:17.111 --> 00:01:18.385
here in Haiti.
Thank you.

00:01:18.385 --> 00:01:19.504
That's an official position.

00:01:19.504 --> 00:01:20.337
Nice!
And with it

00:01:20.337 --> 00:01:23.420
comes great power and lots of ladies.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.333
Responsibilities?

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:27.166
No, no, no.

00:01:27.166 --> 00:01:28.306
With great power comes lots of ladies.

00:01:28.306 --> 00:01:29.436
That's what Spiderman says.

00:01:29.436 --> 00:01:31.353
No Spiderman's lying.

00:01:32.818 --> 00:01:33.651
Oh you did?

00:01:33.651 --> 00:01:34.504
Yeah I'm a comic book artist.

00:01:34.504 --> 00:01:35.426
A Haitian superhero?

00:01:35.426 --> 00:01:37.525
Yeah.
Terrific, tell me about him.

00:01:37.525 --> 00:01:38.358
What's his name?

00:01:38.358 --> 00:01:40.587
Djatawo.
Djatawo, I love that!

00:01:40.587 --> 00:01:41.481
What's his superpower?

00:01:41.481 --> 00:01:42.504
He can teleport himself

00:01:42.504 --> 00:01:44.921
and he can also use his energy--

00:01:44.921 --> 00:01:46.298
If he can teleport himself is that because

00:01:46.298 --> 00:01:47.771
there's so much traffic in Port-au-Prince?

00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:48.609
That's true!

00:01:48.609 --> 00:01:50.248
That's why you came up
with the idea, right?

00:01:50.248 --> 00:01:51.255
Yeah, yeah!

00:01:51.255 --> 00:01:53.154
Can I say Djatawo's greatest power?

00:01:53.154 --> 00:01:55.138
He can turn a break-up with a girlfriend

00:01:55.138 --> 00:01:56.546
into something positive.

00:01:56.546 --> 00:01:58.463
That's Djatawo's power.

00:02:00.102 --> 00:02:01.528
You are amazing.

00:02:01.528 --> 00:02:03.312
Put this on your local tap-tap.

00:02:03.312 --> 00:02:04.167
Anthony before you go,

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:05.835
I want to present you with something.

00:02:05.835 --> 00:02:08.093
We are Team Coco and I want you to have

00:02:08.093 --> 00:02:10.847
a Team Coco shirt.
Oh this is so cool.

00:02:10.847 --> 00:02:12.146
Now there's one problem.

00:02:12.146 --> 00:02:12.979
What is it?

00:02:12.979 --> 00:02:15.096
I found out that Coco has meaning

00:02:15.096 --> 00:02:15.929
(laughing)

00:02:15.929 --> 00:02:18.126
in Haiti that we didn't
know anything about.

00:02:18.126 --> 00:02:19.350
We found out here that Coco means,

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:20.234
and you can say it.

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:21.067
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:21.900
What's it say?

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:22.733
Vagina.

00:02:22.733 --> 00:02:23.566
Don't be scared.

00:02:23.566 --> 00:02:24.635
(laughing)
See that's part of the reason

00:02:24.635 --> 00:02:25.529
you guys broke up.

00:02:25.529 --> 00:02:26.579
You were afraid.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.009
(laughing)

00:02:28.009 --> 00:02:28.842
Vagina.

00:02:30.039 --> 00:02:31.562
I wanted to thank Nadesh Delfourt.

00:02:31.562 --> 00:02:32.737
She's the one who brought me here.

00:02:32.737 --> 00:02:33.570
Where is she?

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:34.403
What is your name?

00:02:34.403 --> 00:02:35.236
Nadesh.

00:02:35.236 --> 00:02:36.069
You are gorgeous.

00:02:36.069 --> 00:02:36.902
You're beautiful.
Thank you.

00:02:36.902 --> 00:02:39.404
How long have you two known each other?

00:02:39.404 --> 00:02:40.237
Long time.

00:02:40.237 --> 00:02:42.266
Like almost 20 years, something?

00:02:42.266 --> 00:02:43.099
Yeah.
Wow.

00:02:43.099 --> 00:02:44.076
And now he's single.

00:02:44.076 --> 00:02:45.917
Are you single?

00:02:45.917 --> 00:02:46.867
No, I'm not single.

00:02:46.867 --> 00:02:50.664
Unfortunately, I'm not.
(laughing)

00:02:50.664 --> 00:02:52.331
That could change?

00:02:53.349 --> 00:02:54.949
Nothing, nothing.

00:02:54.949 --> 00:02:56.894
Because he is now Team Coco,

00:02:56.894 --> 00:03:00.110
we looked up the word for the male part.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:00.943
(laughing)

00:03:00.943 --> 00:03:02.693
You can be Team Zozo.

00:03:04.782 --> 00:03:05.615
So anyway.

00:03:07.152 --> 00:03:10.107
We're gonna sell a lot of these in Haiti.

00:03:10.107 --> 00:03:11.252
Always a man of my word,

00:03:11.252 --> 00:03:13.652
I commissioned Anthony
to execute his vision.

00:03:13.652 --> 00:03:15.580
And within 24 hours I was immortalized

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.913
on Haitian public transport.

00:03:21.932 --> 00:03:22.899
To check out Thony's artwork,

00:03:22.899 --> 00:03:25.102
including his Haitian superhero,

00:03:25.102 --> 00:03:26.602
go to djatawo.com.

